      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1020184429,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1907818923,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A privileged basis is one where the STANDARD BASIS DIRECTIONS are meaningful (due to the structure",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A privileged basis is one where the STANDARD BASIS DIRECTIONS are meaningful (due to the structure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "v12ii826gyup12spfhv5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 1706.0,
      "width": 672.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 224110542,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2064121138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "of computation).  Does NOT mean the basis is interpretable - just that basis directions are special.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "of computation).  Does NOT mean the basis is interpretable - just that basis directions are special.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
