      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "As SPARSITY INCREASES, we get MORE polysemantic neurons.  Why:",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "As SPARSITY INCREASES, we get MORE polysemantic neurons.  Why:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nqyyf9rk7d30mm2smdzq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 2834.0,
      "width": 12.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 288511613,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1289624428,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bzamd270stlpq2wgxo05",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 2858.0,
      "width": 672.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1930909979,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1844915412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  When features rarely co-occur, cross-talk between shared dims rarely matters.  A single neuron can",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  When features rarely co-occur, cross-talk between shared dims rarely matters.  A single neuron can",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nzh13cd5glqj5sxvwvm4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 2882.0,
      "width": 639.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 741000012,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1277515812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  safely encode several sparse features.  Interference only hurts when both features are active",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  safely encode several sparse features.  Interference only hurts when both features are active",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7vylienfnvuprt77ggkg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 2906.0,
      "width": 480.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1937034432,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 230258602,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  simultaneously, and if features are sparse enough, that's negligible.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  simultaneously, and if features are sparse enough, that's negligible.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "58rhnuxorzpgu2hbik2u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
