      "text": "Sampling + importance:  the two dials that drive geometry",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 27,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sampling + importance:  the two dials that drive geometry",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qe7ajul7w8cof3138i2x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 8268.0,
      "width": 1041.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1679330783,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 830523410,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SPARSITY S = P(feature is zero).  Feature probability p = 1 - S.  IMPORTANCE I_i weights per-feature MSE in the loss.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SPARSITY S = P(feature is zero).  Feature probability p = 1 - S.  IMPORTANCE I_i weights per-feature MSE in the loss.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "imi8fo0vyhfjlwss1vip",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 8296.0,
      "width": 1024.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 536288909,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1951493271,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Together they determine what the trained W looks like: which features get represented, and what geometry they take.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Together they determine what the trained W looks like: which features get represented, and what geometry they take.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
