      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "During and after training, we need concrete numbers to measure WHAT the model learned.  Here are all the metrics used in the exercises.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "During and after training, we need concrete numbers to measure WHAT the model learned.  Here are all the metrics used in the exercises.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ls394vbcw3j8tuwcg7jc",
      "type": "text",
