      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So the rotated 'ReLU' is a COMPLETELY DIFFERENT function of x', y'.  It's no longer elementwise.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So the rotated 'ReLU' is a COMPLETELY DIFFERENT function of x', y'.  It's no longer elementwise.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l735bfkqa3zthkfgulc4",
