      "locked": false,
      "text": "Computation in superposition:  compute  |x|  for signed x",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 27,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Computation in superposition:  compute  |x|  for signed x",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zkxbghmj52ti00mzi4yr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 21836.035496727658,
      "width": 1217.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1240699364,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 584785048,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NeuronModel task was reconstruct-x, which is LINEAR - model bypasses ReLU via bias shift.  To study COMPUTATION we need a nonlinear task.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NeuronModel task was reconstruct-x, which is LINEAR - model bypasses ReLU via bias shift.  To study COMPUTATION we need a nonlinear task.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0yhmj0bsiuzsu3txispl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 21864.035496727658,
      "width": 1147.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 21277344,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1887195904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use  |x|  for x in [-1, 1].  Since  |x| = ReLU(x) + ReLU(-x), the ReLU MUST fire.  Now we can study computation-in-superposition.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Use  |x|  for x in [-1, 1].  Since  |x| = ReLU(x) + ReLU(-x), the ReLU MUST fire.  Now we can study computation-in-superposition.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
