      "versionNonce": 544870498,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  3. Fortunately, abs is easy to build from ReLU:",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  3. Fortunately, abs is easy to build from ReLU:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "85cqhggjy0q7wwkfri0b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 22630.035496727658,
      "width": 287.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1691390622,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1322436382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "         |x|  =  ReLU(x)  +  ReLU(-x)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "         |x|  =  ReLU(x)  +  ReLU(-x)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ko6rih05iiy8g53kzemv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 22654.035496727658,
      "width": 614.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1272706161,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1806799268,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "     Monosemantic solution: 2 neurons per feature (one for +half, one for -half).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "     Monosemantic solution: 2 neurons per feature (one for +half, one for -half).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a8lpyzkwkc8wydczsmv1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 22678.035496727658,
      "width": 681.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 548730796,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 271415179,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "     5 features * 2 neurons = 10 neurons monosemantic.  We only have d_hidden=5 (or fewer)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "     5 features * 2 neurons = 10 neurons monosemantic.  We only have d_hidden=5 (or fewer)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
