      "text": "8-stage tensor flow.  Encoder centers h by b_dec, projects via W_enc + b_enc, ReLUs into sparse latent code z.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8-stage tensor flow.  Encoder centers h by b_dec, projects via W_enc + b_enc, ReLUs into sparse latent code z.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "szici92sdiamcwzjmhk7",
