    },
    {
      "id": "e7hvnfhrpchmdrbi6v8t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 32995.315266036036,
      "width": 257.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1251187565,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1321086883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why scale L1 by decoder row norm:",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why scale L1 by decoder row norm:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pk2k9wg6qe1r5bpenegm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 33019.315266036036,
      "width": 763.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1607791912,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 767142989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  Without it, the model can 'cheat' by scaling z DOWN and W_dec UP  (same h_hat, smaller |z|, smaller",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  Without it, the model can 'cheat' by scaling z DOWN and W_dec UP  (same h_hat, smaller |z|, smaller",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6igcxokongthgtcsw966",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 33043.315266036036,
      "width": 607.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 743258900,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2076863054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  sparsity loss).  Scaling L1 by ||W_dec[i, :]|| removes this degree of freedom.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  sparsity loss).  Scaling L1 by ||W_dec[i, :]|| removes this degree of freedom.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u2ca6ag88s476esro7v4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 33067.315266036036,
      "width": 666.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2085718433,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1084464654,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  Alternative: normalize W_dec rows to unit norm during forward, then use plain ||z||_1.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  Alternative: normalize W_dec rows to unit norm during forward, then use plain ||z||_1.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "trcfhsej8ifpud6saor7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 33091.315266036036,
      "width": 540.0,
      "height": 16.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 793131723,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1452173392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  In code: W_dec_normalized is a property that does this normalization.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  In code: W_dec_normalized is a property that does this normalization.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gwsvbgf0lmckzo3kgshs",
      "type": "rectangle",
