      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JumpReLU SAE: threshold activation + L0 penalty via STE",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 27,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JumpReLU SAE: threshold activation + L0 penalty via STE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "d0si5c75b20137nldhic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 40557.33980591334,
      "width": 1164.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 809556979,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1313803684,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same architecture as standard SAE, but the activation is JumpReLU_theta(z) = z * H(z - theta).  Learned per-latent threshold theta.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Same architecture as standard SAE, but the activation is JumpReLU_theta(z) = z * H(z - theta).  Learned per-latent threshold theta.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uvpulhjsarq9kcpdwa1i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 40585.33980591334,
      "width": 997.0,
      "height": 21.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1230398444,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 661473076,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Penalize L0 directly (not L1).  Backprop through Heaviside via straight-through estimator with rectangle kernel.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Penalize L0 directly (not L1).  Backprop through Heaviside via straight-through estimator with rectangle kernel.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
